<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Brightmoon Institution (Catradora Boarding School AU)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora called out across the ice, feeling as if she was floating on air. It was a strange sense of euphoria, the wind biting her skin and the vast sea of stars above her. It almost felt surreal. What made it even more unbelievable was the girl in front of her, chuckling as she watched Adora trip over herself slightly as she realized the weight of this experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--------&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A socially isolated girl leaves the comfort of an abusive mother to meet a world of richness, both metaphorically and literally. Though Adora is undoubtedly intelligent, her confinement in Shadow Weaver's home prevents her from fulfilling her 'lifelong pursuit' of becoming President. After eleven years of carefully monitored studies, Adora leaves to attend the Brightmoon Institution, an academy founded to educate the brightest minds.&lt;br /&gt;There she makes friends....as well as enemies. Cue Catra. A forgotten ally from a forgotten place, a reawakened memory in Adora's mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--------&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Most characters are created and owned by the creator and writers of SPOP, I'm merely presenting my interpretation of them.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>bleeber</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
